WHERE slug = 'casinovasgaming-xp-leveling-explained' AND status = 'published';

-- welcome-to-casinova
UPDATE public.blog_posts SET
  title = $t$Welcome to Casinova Gaming: How to Get Started$t$,
  excerpt = $t$To get started at Casinova Gaming, create a free account, deposit by card, open a live game such as Juwa or Game Vault, create your game login and load $5 to $500 from your wallet. Your first deposit is matched 100% and your second 50% when you load. Upload a government ID early, because every redeem needs an approved ID.$t$,
  content = $t$<p>To get started at Casinova Gaming, create a free account, deposit by card, open a live game such as Juwa or Game Vault, create your game login and load $5 to $500 from your wallet. Your first deposit is matched 100% and your second 50% when you load. Upload a government ID early, because every redeem needs an approved ID.</p>

<h2>Before you sign up</h2>
<p>Casinova Gaming is a sweepstakes gaming platform, not a licensed casino. It is for adults 18 and over, and availability varies by jurisdiction, so check the rules where you live first. Outcomes in every game are based on chance. Only deposit money you can afford to lose.</p>

<h2>Step 1: Create your account</h2>
<p>Register with your email and verify it. Use your real name: the name on your account needs to match the ID you upload later. It is one account per person. Once you are in, the dashboard shows your wallet, your game panels, the daily spin and your VIP tier, which starts at Bronze.</p>

<h2>Step 2: Upload your ID</h2>
<p>You can deposit, load and play before your ID is checked, but redeem stays locked until it is approved. The review is done by a person, so the time depends on the queue. Uploading on day one means the check is usually finished long before you need it. The <a href="/blog/casinova-id-verification-guide">ID verification guide</a> explains what photo to take and why uploads get rejected.</p>

<h2>Step 3: Deposit by card</h2>
<p>Open Deposit in your dashboard, pick an amount and pay on the payment partner's checkout page. Card is the only method. Cash App, Zelle, Venmo, PayPal, Chime and crypto are not offered, and nobody from Casinova will ask you to pay that way. When checkout completes, the money shows in your wallet. Each step is covered in the <a href="/blog/wallet-deposit-guide-casinovasgaming">card deposit guide</a>.</p>

<h2>Step 4: Pick a live game and create your login</h2>
<p>Eight games can be loaded now:</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="/games/game-vault">Game Vault</a>: slots, keno and fish games in one lobby.</li>
<li><a href="/games/juwa">Juwa</a>: slots, fish games and table-style games.</li>
<li><a href="/games/mr-all-in-one">MR All In One</a>: slots, fish and keno in one app.</li>
<li><a href="/games/cash-machine">Cash Machine</a> and <a href="/games/cash-frenzy">Cash Frenzy</a>: slots.</li>
<li><a href="/games/vegas-sweeps">Vegas Sweeps</a>: slots, keno and fish games.</li>
<li><a href="/games/gameroom">Gameroom</a>: slots, fish games and keno.</li>
<li><a href="/games/mafia">Mafia</a>: themed slots.</li>
</ul>
<p>Open the game's page and use the panel to create your game account. Your login appears in the panel when it is ready. Games marked "soon" on the <a href="/games">games page</a> are not available to load yet. If you cannot decide, the <a href="/blog/best-fish-table-games-beginners">beginner ranking</a> orders the live games by how easy they are to start.</p>

<h2>Step 5: Load credits</h2>
<p>In the same panel, enter an amount from $5 to $500 and load. Amounts round to the nearest dollar. This is the moment the deposit match is applied:</p>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Deposit</th><th>Match</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>First</td><td>100%</td><td>$20 deposited, $20 bonus</td></tr>
<tr><td>Second</td><td>50%</td><td>$20 deposited, $10 bonus</td></tr>
<tr><td>Third and later</td><td>None</td><td>$20 deposited, no bonus</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>There are no promo codes to enter and no free credits to claim. The match is automatic. More detail is in <a href="/blog/how-to-load-credits-from-wallet">how to load credits</a> and the <a href="/blog/maximize-fish-table-bonus">deposit bonus guide</a>.</p>

<h2>Step 6: Play</h2>
<p>Open the provider's app or web player and sign in with the login from your panel. The <a href="/blog/how-to-play-casinova-on-mobile">mobile guide</a> covers Android and iPhone. A first session goes better with a small load and a low bet, so you learn the game before the balance is gone.</p>

<h2>Step 7: Redeem</h2>
<p>Use Check balance in the panel. When the in-game balance is at least 3x your load, you can submit a redeem from the panel. Total redeems on a load are capped at 8x. You need an approved ID, and a staff member reviews each request. There is no promised payout time. The full process is in <a href="/blog/how-to-redeem-winnings-fast">how to redeem</a>.</p>

<h2>Free things to do every day</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Daily spin.</strong> The <a href="/spin">wheel</a> pays $1, $2, $3, $4, $7 or $10, or nothing. Bronze members get one spin per 24 hours.</li>
<li><strong>Daily check-in.</strong> The Daily rewards page in your dashboard adds VIP points each day you claim.</li>
<li><strong>Referral code.</strong> Your Referrals page has a code to share. You receive a share of a referred friend's first deposit (5% at Bronze) and 10 VIP points.</li>
</ul>
<p>VIP points move you from Bronze to Silver at 500, Gold at 2,000 and Platinum at 5,000. The <a href="/vip">VIP page</a> shows what each tier changes.</p>

<h2>If you get stuck</h2>
<p>Use the chat bubble on the site or the Messages inbox in your dashboard; support is available 24/7. The <a href="/support">support page</a> answers the common questions. And if playing stops being enjoyable, the <a href="/responsible-play">responsible play page</a> lists ways to take a break.</p>

<h2>FAQ</h2>
<h3>How much do I need to start?</h3>
<p>The minimum load is $5 and the maximum is $500 per load. Creating an account is free.</p>
<h3>Do I need a promo code for the first-deposit bonus?</h3>
<p>No. The 100% match on your first deposit and 50% on your second are applied automatically when you load a game. Casinova has no promo codes or bonus codes.</p>
<h3>Can I play before my ID is approved?</h3>
<p>Yes. Deposits, game logins and loads work before verification. Only redeem is locked until your ID is approved.</p>
<h3>Which game should I load first?</h3>
<p>Slots are the simplest format to learn, so a slots-heavy game such as Game Vault or Cash Machine is a gentle first load. Pick by the type of game you enjoy.</p>
<h3>How do I pay?</h3>
<p>By card through the payment partner's checkout. No other payment method is offered.</p>

<p><a href="/register?src=blog_welcome-to-casinova&amp;utm_source=blog&amp;utm_medium=cta&amp;utm_campaign=welcome-to-casinova">Create your free account</a> and take your first daily spin while your ID is in review.</p>
<p>Casinova Gaming is for players 18+. Sweepstakes availability varies by jurisdiction; void where prohibited.</p>$t$,
