<p>In sweepstakes and casino marketing, a "no-deposit bonus" is a balance handed to a new account before any payment, often tied to a sign-up code. People search for it because it sounds like a free trial. Casinova does not work that way. A new account starts with an empty wallet, and game credits come from a card deposit that you load into a game.</p>
<p>If your last platform used free Gold Coins and Sweeps Coins, that is a different model again. Casinova has one wallet and no second currency, as <a href="/blog/sweeps-coins-explained">sweeps coins explained</a> describes.</p>

<h2>What Casinova offers instead</h2>
<table>
