<p>Because the first match is the largest and only happens once, the size of your first deposit decides how much bonus you ever receive from it. That is not a reason to deposit more than you planned. It is a reason to decide your budget before the first deposit and not after. The <a href="/blog/maximize-fish-table-bonus">deposit bonus guide</a> and the <a href="/blog/deposit-amounts-and-limits-casinova">limits guide</a> go through the details.</p>

