<p>The <a href="/spin">daily spin</a> is the closest thing Casinova has to something for nothing. You need an account, not a deposit. Bronze members get one spin per 24 hours, Silver two, Gold and Platinum three. The wheel has cash segments of $1, $2, $3, $4, $7 and $10 and segments that pay nothing, and a blank is a normal result.</p>
