<p>The <a href="/blog/is-casinovasgaming-legit">legit check</a> lists what you can verify on the real site.</p>

<h2>Trying a game for the smallest amount</h2>
<p>If what you want is a low-risk first look, the practical route is a $5 first deposit. With the 100% match that is a $5 load plus a $5 bonus in the game. Pick something simple to learn, such as slots in <a href="/games/cash-machine">Cash Machine</a> or the mixed lobby in <a href="/games/game-vault">Game Vault</a>, and keep the bet low so the session lasts. Results are based on chance, and a $5 load can run out quickly. Treat it as the price of trying the game, and read the <a href="/responsible-play">responsible play page</a> if you find yourself reloading to chase it.</p>

