  content = $t$<p>Fish table sweepstakes games are arcade-style shooters, where you fire at fish that each carry a credit value, offered on a platform that runs under a sweepstakes model and not as a licensed casino. At Casinova Gaming, fish games sit inside live apps such as Juwa, Game Vault and Vegas Sweeps. You deposit by card, load $5 to $500 into the app, and can redeem once the game balance reaches 3x the load.</p>

<h2>Two ideas in one phrase</h2>
<p>"Fish table sweepstakes" joins a game format and a platform model, and it helps to separate them.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Fish table</strong> is the format. Players share a screen full of moving fish. Each shot costs credits at the bet you choose, and a fish that is caught pays credits back. The name comes from the arcade cabinets built as a table with seats around it. <a href="/blog/what-is-a-fish-table-game">What is a fish table game</a> explains the format on its own.</li>
<li><strong>Sweepstakes</strong> is the model the platform operates under. It is a different category from a licensed casino. <a href="/blog/what-are-sweepstakes-games">What are sweepstakes games</a> covers the model in plain terms.</li>
</ul>
<p>One caution on the second point: a sweepstakes model is not the same as being permitted everywhere. Availability varies by jurisdiction, Casinova makes no claim about any location, and checking the rules where you live is up to you.</p>

<h2>How a fish table round works</h2>
<ol>
<li>You pick a room, usually sorted by stake.</li>
<li>You set a bet per shot. Higher bets cost more per shot and pay more per catch.</li>
<li>You aim and fire. Small fish take fewer hits and pay less; larger targets take more and pay more.</li>
<li>Whether a shot catches a fish is decided by the game's software. It is chance, not marksmanship.</li>
</ol>
<p>That last step is the one people misread. Aiming well stops you wasting shots on empty water, but it does not change the odds on any single hit. The providers do not publish odds or RTP for these games, and no timing trick or pattern makes a catch certain. What you do control is the bet per shot and how long you stay, which is why honest advice about fish tables is mostly about pacing. The <a href="/blog/fish-table-vs-slots-which-is-better">fish table versus slots comparison</a> shows how quickly each format uses a balance.</p>

<h2>Where to find fish games at Casinova</h2>
