<h2>How the Casinova side works</h2>
<ol>
<li><strong>Create a free account</strong> and verify your email.</li>
<li><strong>Deposit by card</strong> through the payment partner. Card is the only method; Cash App, Zelle, Venmo, PayPal, Chime and crypto are not offered. See the <a href="/blog/wallet-deposit-guide-casinovasgaming">deposit guide</a>.</li>
