<p>The genre is simple to describe. You sit at a cannon on a shared table, set a bet per shot, and fire at fish that swim across the screen. Each fish carries a multiplier; larger fish and bosses pay more and take more shots. Other players share the room and shoot the same fish. Outcomes per shot are decided by the game software. <a href="/blog/what-is-a-fish-table-game">What a fish table game is</a> covers the format in full.</p>

