<h2>Two sites, two jobs</h2>
<p>Most confusion about "Game Vault online" comes from mixing up who does what.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Game Vault</strong> is the game. The provider runs the lobby, the individual titles and their results. You play there, in the provider's web player or app.</li>
<li><strong>Casinova Gaming</strong> is where your money and login are managed. Your wallet, your Game Vault username and password, loads and redeems all live on the <a href="/games/game-vault">Game Vault page</a> at Casinova.</li>
