<p>Your first deposit is matched 100% at load and your second 50%. After that there is no match. A $15 first-deposit load therefore puts $30 into Juwa. There are no promo codes or free credits to enter anywhere in this process. The <a href="/blog/how-to-load-credits-from-wallet">load guide</a> and the <a href="/blog/maximize-fish-table-bonus">bonus guide</a> have the detail.</p>

