<p>An arcade lobby in this sense is a mixed app. You sign in once and choose between game types from a menu, the way you would walk between cabinets in an arcade. That matters for picking an alternative, because the question is not "which fish game is like it" but "which live lobby gives me the same kind of mix".</p>

