  content = $t$<p>Milky Way is coming soon at Casinova Gaming and cannot be loaded, requested or downloaded through Casinova yet, with no launch date announced. It is listed under the category Space as a space-themed app with slots and fish games, so it is not purely a fish table. The closest live game is Game Vault, which pairs a deep slot catalog with fish tables.</p>

